[05/19 14:05:05     42s] @file 201:
[05/19 14:05:05     42s] @file 202: # Create well taps
[05/19 14:05:05     42s] @file 203: # Explanation : We need to add well taps, to bias the bulk of the transistors to the correct potential
[05/19 14:05:05     42s] @file 204: #               According to the documentation, the maximum distance a cell can have to a well tap is 30um.
[05/19 14:05:05     42s] @file 205: #               This means that if we space the well taps with 60um, all cells will be within the 30um range of a tap.
[05/19 14:05:05     42s] @@file 206: add_well_taps -cell_interval 60
